---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Tenement Facade Renovation — Historic Building Restoration" description="Tenement and historic building facade renovation in Krakow. Detail restoration, stucco work, interior insulation. Heritage conservation experience." schemaType="services" locale="en">
  <section class="relative pt-32 pb-16 bg-slate-900 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-900/80 via-slate-900/95 to-slate-900"></div></div>
    <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1.5 bg-red-600"></div>
    <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
      <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-400 mb-8"><a href="/en" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Home</a><span>/</span><a href="/en/services" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Services</a><span>/</span><span class="text-orange-400">Tenement Facade Renovation</span></nav>
      <div class="text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-orange-500/10 border border-orange-500/20 mb-6"><span class="text-orange-400 text-sm font-semibold">Heritage Restoration</span></div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">Tenement Facade <span class="text-gradient">Renovation</span></h1>
        <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-slate-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">We restore the glory of Krakow's historic facades. We recreate stucco, cornices, and architectural details while respecting the building's historical character.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-padding bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-6">What is <span class="text-gradient">tenement facade renovation</span>?</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">Tenement facade renovation is a comprehensive process of restoring the original appearance and technical condition of historic building facades. Unlike standard facade work, renovation requires specialist knowledge of heritage conservation, historical building techniques, and the ability to recreate architectural details.</p>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">Krakow, with its rich architectural heritage, has thousands of tenements requiring expert renovation. Many are listed as historic monuments or located in conservation protection zones, requiring close cooperation with the Municipal Heritage Conservator.</p>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Our company specializes in Krakow tenement renovation — from 19th-century Art Nouveau buildings of Kazimierz, through classicist tenements of the Old Town, to modernist buildings of Podgorze. Each project is treated individually, matching technology and materials to the building's era and style.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-padding bg-slate-900">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white mb-6">Let us restore your tenement's <span class="text-gradient">former glory</span></h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-400 mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Contact us for a free building inspection and renovation quote. We advise on conservation matters and help with documentation.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
        <a href="/en/contact" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-500 text-white font-semibold rounded-xl transition-colors">Free renovation quote</a>
        <a href="tel:+48515156233" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white font-semibold rounded-xl border border-white/20 transition-colors">Call: 515-156-233</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
